  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 1582,
      "text": "Have no doubt about what they worship; they only worship what their forefathers worshiped. We will surely give them their full share undiminished.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 11,
        "name": "سُورَةُ هُودٍ",
        "englishName": "Hud",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Hud",
        "numberOfAyahs": 123,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 109,
      "juz": 12,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 234,
      "ruku": 191,
      "hizbQuarter": 94,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1583,
      "text": "We gave Moses the Scripture, but a dispute arose about it. If it had not been for a prior decree from your Lord, the matter would have been decided between them[56]. They are indeed in a disquieting doubt about it.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 11,
        "name": "سُورَةُ هُودٍ",
        "englishName": "Hud",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Hud",
        "numberOfAyahs": 123,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 110,
      "juz": 12,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 234,
      "ruku": 192,
      "hizbQuarter": 94,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1584,
      "text": "Your Lord will surely pay everyone in full for their deeds, for He is All-Aware of what they do.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 11,
        "name": "سُورَةُ هُودٍ",
        "englishName": "Hud",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Hud",
        "numberOfAyahs": 123,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 111,
      "juz": 12,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 234,
      "ruku": 192,
      "hizbQuarter": 94,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1585,
      "text": "So stay on a straight path as you have been commanded, along with those who repented with you, and do not cross the limits[57]. Indeed, He is All-Seeing of what you do.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 11,
        "name": "سُورَةُ هُودٍ",
        "englishName": "Hud",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Hud",
        "numberOfAyahs": 123,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 112,
      "juz": 12,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 234,
      "ruku": 192,
      "hizbQuarter": 94,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1586,
      "text": "Do not incline to the wrongdoers, or else the Fire will seize you. Then you will have no protectors besides Allah, nor will you be helped.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 11,
        "name": "سُورَةُ هُودٍ",
        "englishName": "Hud",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Hud",
        "numberOfAyahs": 123,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 113,
      "juz": 12,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 234,
      "ruku": 192,
      "hizbQuarter": 94,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1587,
      "text": "Establish prayer at the two ends of the day and at some hours of the night. Indeed, good deeds wipe out evil deeds[58]. This is a reminder for those who are mindful.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 11,
        "name": "سُورَةُ هُودٍ",
        "englishName": "Hud",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Hud",
        "numberOfAyahs": 123,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 114,
      "juz": 12,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 234,
      "ruku": 192,
      "hizbQuarter": 94,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1588,
      "text": "And be patient, for indeed Allah does not let the reward of those who do good to go to waste.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 11,
        "name": "سُورَةُ هُودٍ",
        "englishName": "Hud",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Hud",
        "numberOfAyahs": 123,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 115,
      "juz": 12,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 234,
      "ruku": 192,
      "hizbQuarter": 94,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1589,
      "text": "If only there had been among the generations before you righteous people who would forbid others from spreading corruption in the land, except a few of them whom We saved. But the wrongdoers pursued their luxury[59] which they were given therein, and they were wicked.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 11,
        "name": "سُورَةُ هُودٍ",
        "englishName": "Hud",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Hud",
        "numberOfAyahs": 123,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 116,
      "juz": 12,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 234,
      "ruku": 192,
      "hizbQuarter": 94,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1590,
      "text": "Your Lord would never destroy the towns unjustly while their people were acting righteously.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 11,
        "name": "سُورَةُ هُودٍ",
        "englishName": "Hud",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Hud",
        "numberOfAyahs": 123,
